<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

    <parent>
        <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
        <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-parent</artifactId>
        <version>3.5.16</version>
        <relativePath/>
    </parent>

    <groupId>br.uece.llm</groupId>
    <artifactId>common</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
    <name>common</name>
    <description>Codigo compartilhado do padrao Function Calling (modelo de mensagens, ToolRegistry,
        ferramentas de exemplo e cliente Anthropic) entre function-calling-demo e rag-function-calling.
        Nao inclui nada do padrao ReAct (react-agent): o contrato de Tool/LlmClient la e' baseado em
        texto livre, incompativel com o contrato estruturado (JSON) usado aqui, e react-agent roda em
        Spring Boot 4 / Jackson 3 enquanto este modulo roda em Spring Boot 3.5 / Jackson 2.</description>

    <properties>
        <java.version>21</java.version>
        <mockito.version>5.19.0</mockito.version>
        <byte-buddy.version>1.17.5</byte-buddy.version>
    </properties>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-test</artifactId>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>
</project>
